nt DMG from GitHub Releases."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"The App contains its own Node runtime, Taskboard service, built web UI, Skill, CLI wrapper, and inje"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"ction script. It starts the service, reuses an open Codex with a reachable CDP renderer, opens Taskb"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"oard in the native browser panel of an ordinary Codex without CDP, or launches the official Codex ap"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"p when no Codex is open. It waits for the renderer, injects the sidebar entry when CDP is available,"},{"id":"p39s5","text":" and opens the panel without showing a terminal window. The App can be copied away from this checkou"},{"id":"p39s6","text":"t; the target Mac only needs the official Codex app and does not need this repository, a system Node"},{"id":"p39s7","text":" installation, or a separate Codex CLI installation. Taskboard data is stored in `~/Library/Applicat"},{"id":"p39s8","text":"ion Support/Codex Taskboard`, and launcher output is written to `~/Library/Logs/Codex Taskboard/code"},{"id":"p39s9","text":"x-taskboard-launcher.log`."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"### Linux App: Ubuntu 24.04 x64 packages"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"The first Linux desktop release supports Ubuntu 24.04 LTS on x64 only. Install the official ChatGPT "},{"id":"p41s2","text":"desktop `.deb` first and confirm that `chatgpt` opens it. Then download either the Codex Taskboard `"},{"id":"p41s3","text":".deb` or `.AppImage` from GitHub Releases. Replace `<file>` below with the downloaded filename."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Install the `.deb` package:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Or run the AppImage:"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"To build both packages on Ubuntu 24.04 x64, run:"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"This first release does not support ARM64, Fedora, RPM packages, or other Linux distributions."},{"id":"p49s1","text":"### Windows code signing"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"For official Windows releases after the application is approved: **Free code signing provided by Sig"},{"id":"p50s2","text":"nPath.io, certificate by SignPath Foundation.** Current Windows CI artifacts remain unsigned until t"},{"id":"p50s3","text":"hat approval. See the Code signing policy, Privacy policy, and Windows uninstall instructions."},{"id":"p51s1","text":"The local build uses ad-hoc code signing for direct verification. A public macOS download still need"},{"id":"p51s2","text":"s Developer ID signing and Apple notarization."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"},{"content":"上次校验失败；重新生成完整对象。evidence本次只选1至2条，每个编号必须从实际输入列表复制，不得推算或补造编号。保持摘要简洁，limitations最多3条。错误：["output_not_object","output_not_object","finish_reason"]","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
